                     <colophon xml:id="coloph1">
                        <note xml:lang="en">The colophon states that <roleName type="title">Wayzaro</roleName> <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15145WalattaGiy">Walatta Giyorgis</persName>, wife of
                           <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS7091Mikael"><roleName type="rank">Rās</roleName> Mikāʾel Sǝhul</persName>, commissioned the book in the 2nd year of
                        reign of King <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS9142TaklaGi">Takla Giyorgis</persName>, that is, in <date when="1780">1780</date>), four months before the death of her
                        husband, in the year of John the Evangelist, and donated it to Dabra Dāmmo during the tenure of abbot 
                           <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15146KeflaSellase"><roleName type="title">ʾAbuna</roleName> Kǝfla Śǝllāse</persName>.</note>
                        <locus target="#2va"/>
                        <quote xml:lang="gez">ዝንቱ፡ መጽሐፍ፡ ዘስሙ፡ ፍትሐ፡ ነገሥት። ዘአጽሐፈቶ፡ በንዋያ፡ ወይዘሮ፡ ወለተ፡ ሚካኤል፡ ብእሲቱ፡ ለስሑል፡ ሚካኤል፡ ርእሰ፡ መኳንንት፡ በትፍጻሜተ፡
                        ሢመቱ፡ እምቅድመ፡ ሞቱ፡ በ፬፡ አውራኅ። በዳግማዊ፡ ዓመተ፡ ምንግሥቱ፡ ለንጉሥነ፡ ተክለ፡ ጊዮርጊስ፡ በዘመነ፡ ዮሐንስ፡
                        ወንጌላዊ። ወወሀበቶ፡ ለደብረ፡ ዳሞ፡ መካነ፡ አቡነ፡ አረጋዊ። እንዘ፡ ሀሎ፡ ሥዩመ፡ በዕብሬቱ፡ አቡነ፡ ክፍለ፡ ሥላሴ፡
                        በከዊነ፡ መምህር፡ ወኖላዊ። <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MV"/></quote></colophon>
                  </msItem>
                  
