                        <item xml:id="a1"> 
                           <locus target="#1v"/>
                           <desc type="PurchaseNote">Purchase note concerning the manuscript, written in Amharic in a crude hand. The book was bought by
                              <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15147SebhatZaab"><roleName type="title">Mamhǝr</roleName> Sǝbḥat Zaʾab Walda ʾAbiya ʾAṭqu Gabra Mikāʾel</persName>
                              from <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15147SebhatZaab"><roleName type="title">Mamhǝr</roleName> Gabra Madḫǝn</persName> for 10 Bǝrr.</desc>
                            <q xml:lang="am"> ዘምምር፡<sic/>ገብረ፡ መድኀን፡ መጽሐፍ፡ ሲገዛ፡ መምህር፡
                              ሰብሐት፡ ለአብ፡ ወልደ፡ አቢየ፡ አጥቁ፡ ገብረ፡ ሚካኤል፡ መዝሙር፡ ነበሩ፡ የተገዛ፡ በ፲፡ ብር፡ ነው።</q>
                        </item>
                        
                        <item xml:id="a2"> 
                           <locus target="#2ra"/>
                           <desc type="Inventory">Inventory of land possession of <placeName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/INS0105DD">Dabra Dāmmo</placeName>, most likely written in the same hand as <ref target="#a1"/>.</desc>
                           <q xml:lang="gez">ኆልቈ፡ ገራውሕ፡ ዘደብረ፡ ዳሞ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MV"/></q>
                        </item>
                        
                        <item xml:id="a3"> 
                           <locus from="2vb1" to="2vb11"/>
                           <desc type="Inventory">Inventory of items in the possession of <placeName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/INS0105DD">Dabra Dāmmo</placeName> compiled during the tenure of  the abbot <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15149QalaAb"><roleName type="title">Mamhǝr</roleName> Qāla ʾAb</persName>. 
                              It also mentions <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15150WaldaAragawi"><roleName type="title">Mamhǝr</roleName> Walda ʾAragāwi</persName>, who was in charge of the monastery prior to <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15149QalaAb">Qāla ʾAb</persName>. 
                              It is written in a fine hand.</desc>
                           <q xml:lang="gez">ኍልቈ፡ ንዋያት፡ ዘተኈለቈ፡ በሢመተ፡ መምህር፡ ቃለ፡ አብ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MV"/></q>
                        </item>
                        
                        <item xml:id="a4"> 
                           <locus from="2vb12" to="2vb32"/>
                           <desc type="Inventory">Inventory of items in the possession of <placeName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/INS0105DD">Dabra Dāmmo</placeName>. The note is written in Gǝʿǝz and Amharic. It was compiled during the tenure of 
                              the abbot <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15151GabraAragawi"><roleName type="title">Mamhǝr</roleName> Gabra ʾAragāwi</persName> and lists
                              paraphernalia and the general number of books. It also mentions <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15152TasfaSellase"><roleName type="function">Qes Gabaz</roleName> Tasfā Śǝllāse</persName> and 
                              <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15153GabraMaryam"><roleName type="function">Qes</roleName> Gabra Māryām</persName>. It is written in a mediocre hand.</desc>
                              <q xml:lang="gez">ኍልቈ፡ ንዋያት፡ ዘተኈለቈ፡ በሢመተ፡ መምህር፡ ገብረ፡ አረጋዊ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MV"/></q>
                        </item>
                        
                        <item xml:id="a5"> 
                           <locus target="#2vc"/>
                           <desc type="RecordTransaction">Land transaction written in Gǝʿǝz and Amharic. It states that <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15154Abbay"><roleName type="title">Lǝǧ</roleName> ʾAbbay</persName> (he also appears in <ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/ESmkl005">Bǝḥerāwi Kǝllǝlāwi Mangǝśti Tǝgrāy, Laqāy Kidāna Mǝḥrat, MKL-005</ref>) purchased a rim-land from 
                              <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15155GadluEndreyas"><roleName type="title">ʾAto</roleName> Gadlu ʾƎndrǝyās</persName>; it also mentions several individuals as witnesses, <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15156WaldaGiyorgis"><roleName type="title">Nǝbura ʾƎd</roleName> Walda Giyorgis</persName> 
                              and King <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS10378Yohanne">Yoḥannǝs IV</persName>. It is written in a mediocre hand.</desc>
                           <q xml:lang="gez"> ያቶ: ገድሉ፡ ሪም፡ የነበራ፡ ቤተ፡ ዮሐንስ፡ ተሣየጥኩ፡ አነ፡ ልጅ፡ አባይ፡ እምአቶ፡ ገድሉ፡ እንድርያስ፡ በ፬ብር፡ ለዋና። <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MV"/></q>
                        </item>
                        
                        <item xml:id="a6"> 
                           <locus from="136va" to="136vb"/>
                           <desc type="Inventory">Inventory of items and books compiled during the tenure of  the abbot <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15160TaklaGiyorgis"><roleName type="title">Mamhǝr</roleName> Takla Giyorgis</persName>. 
                              It lists paraphernalia and books with their quantity. It also mentions <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15161WaldaAlfa"><roleName type="function">Qesa Gabaz</roleName> Walda ʾAlfā</persName>, 
                              <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15162GabraArag"><roleName type="function">Qesa Gabaz</roleName> Gabra ʾAragāwi</persName> and 
                              <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15163GabraKres"><roleName type="function">ʾAfa Gabaz</roleName> Gabra Krǝstos</persName>. It is written in a mediocre hand.</desc>
                           <q xml:lang="gez"/>
                        </item>
                        
                        <item xml:id="a7"> 
                           <locus from="136vb13" to="13vb27"/>
                           <desc type="LandGrant">Land grant issued by <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS6668Mangasa"><roleName type="title">Rās</roleName> Mangašā</persName>, son of King <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS10378Yohanne">Yoḥannǝs IV</persName>, 
                              for <placeName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/INS0054SMM">Dabra Māryām of Samāz</placeName>.</desc> 
                           <q xml:lang="gez">ይቤ፡ ራስ፡ መንገሻ፡ ወልደ፡ ንጉሠ፡ ነገሥት፡ ዮሐንስ፡ ወሐብኩ፡ ምድረ፡ አግአ፡ ጥርቄ፡ ለደብረ፡ ማርያም፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MV"/></q>
                        </item>
                        
                        <item xml:id="a8"> 
                           <locus from="136vc1" to="136vc25"/>
                           <desc type="Inventory">Inventory of books and items written during the reign of King <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS10378Yohanne">Yoḥannǝs IV</persName> and the tenure of  
                              the abbot <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15160TaklaGiyorgis"><roleName type="office">Mamhǝr</roleName> Takla Giyorgis</persName>. It also mentions 
                              <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15161WaldaAlfa"><roleName type="function">ʾagbāz</roleName><roleName type="title">ʾAbbā</roleName> Walda ʾAlfā</persName> and 
                              <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15162GabraArag"><roleName type="title">ʾAbbā</roleName> Gabra ʾAragāwi</persName>. 
                              It is written in a mediocre hand.</desc>
                           <q xml:lang="gez">ኌልቀ<sic/>፡ መጻሕፍት፡ ፸፰ቱ፡ ኌልቀ፡ ስያዳ፡ ፶፪ት፡ ኌልቀ፡ ግብረ፡ መርፍዕ፡ ፶፮ት፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MV"/></q>
                        </item>
                        
                        <item xml:id="a9"> 
                           <locus from="136vc26" to="136vc34"/>
                           <desc type="Inventory">Inventory of items and books compiled during the tenure of 
                              the abbot <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15164WaldaAbEgzi"><roleName type="office">Mamhǝr</roleName> Walda ʿAbiya ʾƎgziʾ</persName> and lists paraphernalia and the general
                              number of books. It also mentions <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15165GabraIyasus"><roleName type="function">Qesa Gabaz</roleName> Gabra ʾIyasus</persName> 
                              and <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15166WaldaAbiyaEgzi"><roleName type="function">Qesa Gabaz</roleName> Walda ʿAbiy ʾƎgziʾ</persName>. Some letters are partly erased.</desc>
                           <q xml:lang="gez">ኍልቈ፡ ምንጻፍ፡ ዘስያዳ፡ ፶፬፡ ኍልቈ፡ ግምጅ፡ ፻፲፬፡ ሶራ፡ ፷፪፡ ኍልቈ፡ መጻሕፍት፡ ፹፪። <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MV"/></q>
                        </item>
                        
                        <item xml:id="a10"> 
                           <locus from="137ra" to="138ra"/>
                           <desc type="GuestText">History of Dabra Dāmmo relating that the sanctuary was destroyed by an earthquake during the first year of reign of 
                              King <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS5618IyasuII">ʾIyāsu III</persName>, that is, in <date when="1784">1784</date>, 270 years after that King 
                              <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS6229LebnaDe">Lǝbna Dǝngǝl</persName> had built it, and it was rebuilt thanks to <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS9883WaldaGa"><roleName type="rank">Daǧǧāzmāč</roleName> Walda Gabrǝʾel</persName>
                              The note also mentions other individuals: <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15129Zagiyorgis"><roleName type="office">Mamhǝr</roleName> Zagiyorgis</persName>, 
                              <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15130FessehaS"><roleName type="office">ʾAfa Mamhǝr</roleName> Fǝśśǝḥa Ṣǝyon</persName>, <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15132AnqasaHay">ʾAnqaṣa Hāymānot</persName>, 
                              <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15137FessehaSey"><roleName type="title">ʾAbbā</roleName> Fǝśśǝḥa Ṣǝyon</persName>. 
                               Divine names (Māryām) and elements of Ethiopic numerals are rubricated.</desc>
                           <q xml:lang="gez">ንዌጥን፡ በረድኤተ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ መጽሐፈ፡ ታሪክ፡ ዘደብረ፡ ዳሞ፡ መቅደሰ፡ አባ፡ አረጋዊ፡ ዘከመ፡ ተነሥተት፡ ወተሐንፀት። <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MV"/></q>
                           <q xml:lang="en">We begin with the help of God the book of the Story of Dabra Dāmmo, sanctuary of ʾAbbā ʾAragāwi, how it was destroyed and built <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MV"/></q>
                           
                        </item>
                        <item xml:id="a11"> 
                           <locus from="138ra" to="138rb"/>
                           <desc type="Inventory">Inventory of books and items written in a crude hand. Series of dashes have been inserted above many items in the second part of the note.</desc>
                           <q xml:lang="gez">ኍልቈ፡ መጻሕፍት፡ ፩ኦሪት፡ ሐምስቱ፡ ስንክሳር፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MV"/></q>
                        </item>
                        
                        <item xml:id="a12"> 
                           <locus from="138rc5" to="138rc13"/>
                           <desc type="Inventory">Inventory of items compiled during the tenure of  the abbot <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15167KidanaQal"><roleName type="office">Mamhǝr</roleName> Kidāna Qāl</persName>.</desc>
                           <q xml:lang="gez">ኍልቍ፡ ንዋያት፡ ዘተጽሕፈ፡ በዘመነ፡ መምህር፡ ኪዳነ፡ ቃል፡<gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MV"/></q>
                        </item>
                        
                        <item xml:id="a13"> 
                           <locus from="138rc14" to="138rc25"/>
                           <desc type="Inventory">Inventory of items compiled during the reign of King <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS10378Yohanne">Yoḥannǝs IV</persName> and the tenure of 
                              the abbot <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15168SabhatLaAb"><roleName type="office">Mamhǝr</roleName> Sǝbḥāt LaʾAb</persName>. It also mentions 
                              <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15169NassaraAb"><roleName type="title">ʾAbbā</roleName> Naṣṣara ʾAb</persName> and <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15170WaldaHeyat"><roleName type="title">ʾAbbā</roleName> Walda <choice><sic>Ḥǝyāt</sic> <corr resp="MK">Ḥǝywat</corr></choice></persName>.</desc> 
                           <q xml:lang="gez">ኍልቈ፡ ንዋያት፡ ዘቤተ፡ ክርስቲያን፡ ዘተኈለቈ፡ በዘመነ፡ ዮሐንስ፡ በአባ፡ ስብሐት፡ ለአብ፡ መምሕርነት፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="MV"/></q>
                        </item>
                        
